{"bookId": "3300062265", "title": "哲学如何塑造了我", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1720165871, "updated": [{"bookId": "3300062265", "bookmarkId": "3300062265_15_11970-12339", "createTime": 1720165871, "range": "11970-12339", "markText": "。诸多形而上学观极其不同且无法彼此共存，但科学可以与诸多形而上学观共存。包括爱因斯坦在内的某些最具开创性的20世纪科学家都相信上帝。量子力学的奠基人薛定谔被佛教所吸引。对于科学家个人来说，在他完全接受的科学论断与他持有的那些并非唯物主义的信念之间，不仅没有冲突，而且永远不会有冲突。我察觉到，这种观点如今终于开始传播，尽管持有相反观点的人的数量仍然不少。对于罗素来说，这个现实的处境意味着，无论一个人获得的科学成就有多少，这些科学成就也不会将这个人带到他希望达到的理解水平之上。我确信，这就是罗素保留他自己的哲学家身份的原因。因此罗素花费了他生命的一半时间，试图为如下观点提供令人满意的基础，即哲学对于已知实在的最终解释所根据的是科学哲学与逻辑哲学。罗素从未成功地做到这件事。事实上，他不仅在科学上遭遇了失败，而且也在逻辑学上遭遇了失败。", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15}, {"bookId": "3300062265", "bookmarkId": "3300062265_15_7462-7529", "createTime": 1720161402, "range": "7462-7529", "markText": "那么，数学的基础是什么——鉴于没有自足的前提，没有可以为自己辩护的推理步骤规则，数学能否被一系列的数学推理或其他任何种类的论证所确立？", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "章10章 职业哲学与业余哲学", "chapterUid": 15, "chapterIdx": 15}], "book": {"bookId": "3300062265", "version": 2070890132, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/76/cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq/s_cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq1687246558.jpg", "title": "哲学如何塑造了我", "author": "[英]布莱恩·麦基", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "K7R..70e9FIB?G-U~B?Gxa", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#311500"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#391000"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#400900"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#442c0d"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#4b2900"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#4f2700"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#5d4223"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#64400a"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#693e00"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#723a00"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#805822"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#895500"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#795b36"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#a76e00"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#93744f"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#a36f1d"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#ad8e68"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#b78c51"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#bf8938"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#c98600"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#daa451"}, {"key": "7/10", "hex": "#e1a235"}, {"key": "7/12", "hex": "#e7a000"}, {"key": "8/4", "hex": "#e2c399"}, {"key": "8/6", "hex": "#edc182"}, {"key": "8/12", "hex": "#ffba2d"}, {"key": "9/2", "hex": "#f2e1c8"}, {"key": "9/12", "hex": "#ffd549"}, {"key": "1/100", "hex": "#bf8938"}, {"key": "2/100", "hex": "#daa451"}, {"key": "3/100", "hex": "#ffffff"}, {"key": "4/100", "hex": "#F3EDE5"}, {"key": "5/100", "hex": "#F3EDE5"}, {"key": "6/100", "hex": "#271300"}], "dominate_color": {"hex": "#fbf2e5", "hsv": [34.206135554658026, 9.041389419895596, 98.55197228144988]}, "custom_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookalphacover/265/3300062265/s_3300062265.jpg", "custom_rec_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookreccover/265/3300062265/s_3300062265.jpg", "colorsPure": ["#c98600", "#e7a000"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7SsrfEiwN", "review": {"bookId": "3300062265", "content": "可是哲学家也解释不了这个问题，罗素不就是觉得这种解释没有意义吗？", "bookVersion": 1805157629, "range": "11638-11671", "abstract": "回答这些问题并不是物理学家的职责，物理学家将这些问题交给了哲学家。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "reviewId": "17408780_7SsrfEiwN", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1720163301, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300062265", "format": "epub", "version": 2070890132, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/76/cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq/s_cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq1687246558.jpg", "title": "哲学如何塑造了我", "author": "[英]布莱恩·麦基", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 15, "chapterTitle": "章10章 职业哲学与业余哲学", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Ssr7kfsn", "review": {"bookId": "3300062265", "content": "作者很幽默", "bookVersion": 1805157629, "range": "11187-11228", "abstract": "罗素或许能成为一位伟大的科学哲学家，但我不太相信他能完成爱因斯坦所完成的那种工作。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "reviewId": "17408780_7Ssr7kfsn", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1720163178, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300062265", "format": "epub", "version": 2070890132, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/76/cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq/s_cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq1687246558.jpg", "title": "哲学如何塑造了我", "author": "[英]布莱恩·麦基", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 15, "chapterTitle": "章10章 职业哲学与业余哲学", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7SsqXL4F1", "review": {"bookId": "3300062265", "content": "所以罗素也没打算去解释数学的根本是什么的问题，只要数学可以解释现实的严肃问题，对人类科学有价值就可以了。", "bookVersion": 1805157629, "range": "10679-10880", "abstract": "这就导向了罗素的第二个需要被人们理解的重要观点：他从来也不能理解那种将哲学的构成要素仅仅视为分析的哲学观，他从来也无法弄明白，任何严肃认真的人何以会采纳这样的观点。在他的那个时代将要结束时，罗素相信，哲学的目的就是哲学始终被认为拥有的目的，即理解包括我们自身在内的实在的真实本质。不同智识领域的诸多研究工作，在很大程度上都对这种理解做出了贡献：科学、历史学、多种语言的文学、心理学，以及众多其他的学科。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "reviewId": "17408780_7SsqXL4F1", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1720163037, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300062265", "format": "epub", "version": 2070890132, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/76/cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq/s_cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq1687246558.jpg", "title": "哲学如何塑造了我", "author": "[英]布莱恩·麦基", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 15, "chapterTitle": "章10章 职业哲学与业余哲学", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Ssq2RESs", "review": {"bookId": "3300062265", "content": "所以罗素是一个实用主义者，用人类的价值替换掉了真理的基础，阻止了传统经验哲学的无限的后退。", "bookVersion": 1805157629, "range": "10324-10650", "abstract": "罗素理所当然地认为，只有当分析的是重要的陈述或那种让我们感到困惑的陈述时，这种分析才是有价值的，罗素的目标始终是，澄清我们对这个世界或实在的理解，澄清我们对于事物存在方式的理解。只要一个陈述的真假对我们是重要的，我们将这种严格的技术用来分析这个陈述就是有意义的，因此，这个陈述的重要性位于这种分析过程本身之外，否则整个活动就成了一种恶性循环。实际情况不可能是，仅仅因为我们正在分析这个陈述，这个陈述就对我们是重要的；我们只能是由于这个陈述对我们是重要的，我们才会去分析它。重要性不可能导源于分析，尽管分析能够显示重要性。倘若一种活动是由分析构成的，而在分析之外没有任何目的，这种活动就不具备重要性。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "reviewId": "17408780_7Ssq2RESs", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1720162196, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300062265", "format": "epub", "version": 2070890132, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/76/cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq/s_cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq1687246558.jpg", "title": "哲学如何塑造了我", "author": "[英]布莱恩·麦基", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 15, "chapterTitle": "章10章 职业哲学与业余哲学", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7SspGS3Hh", "review": {"bookId": "3300062265", "content": "逻辑自洽，或者说逻辑闭环并不能证明这个逻辑就是真理。", "bookVersion": 1805157629, "range": "8600-8641", "abstract": "时至今日，逻辑学也未能前进一步，因此显然可以认为，它是一种已经封闭和完成了的学说。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "reviewId": "17408780_7SspGS3Hh", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1720161871, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300062265", "format": "epub", "version": 2070890132, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/76/cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq/s_cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq1687246558.jpg", "title": "哲学如何塑造了我", "author": "[英]布莱恩·麦基", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 15, "chapterTitle": "章10章 职业哲学与业余哲学", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7SsphRG7U", "review": {"bookId": "3300062265", "content": "除了数学的基础是什么的问题，还有一个问题：数学为何是完美的？在宇宙中，时间与空间都不是平整的，量子是不规律的，但是为什么唯独数据定律可以是完美的？", "bookVersion": 1805157629, "range": "7462-7529", "abstract": "那么，数学的基础是什么——鉴于没有自足的前提，没有可以为自己辩护的推理步骤规则，数学能否被一系列的数学推理或其他任何种类的论证所确立？", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "reviewId": "17408780_7SsphRG7U", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1720161502, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300062265", "format": "epub", "version": 2070890132, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/76/cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq/s_cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq1687246558.jpg", "title": "哲学如何塑造了我", "author": "[英]布莱恩·麦基", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 15, "chapterTitle": "章10章 职业哲学与业余哲学", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Ssp7mvBx", "review": {"bookId": "3300062265", "content": "俗话讲叫“眼见为实”，这是人类认知能力的局限。爱因斯坦当年通过广义相对论计算出了遥远星系的“爱因斯坦环”。而人类直到20年后，通过哈勃望远镜观测到了那个类星体的时候，才真正信服了广义相对论。", "bookVersion": 1805157629, "range": "7007-7119", "abstract": "。部分的理由是，在经验主义传统中的哲学家断定，我们关于真实情况的所有有效的推理，最终都可以追溯到直接的观察或经验，也就是说，可以追溯到某种已知是真实的东西，但这并不是由于一系列的推理所得出的结论，而是由于直接被经验到的东西。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "reviewId": "17408780_7Ssp7mvBx", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1720161346, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300062265", "format": "epub", "version": 2070890132, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/76/cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq/s_cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq1687246558.jpg", "title": "哲学如何塑造了我", "author": "[英]布莱恩·麦基", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 15, "chapterTitle": "章10章 职业哲学与业余哲学", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7J8eVI9o4", "review": {"bookVersion": 1805157629, "bookId": "3300062265", "content": "", "type": 4, "star": 100, "reviewId": "17408780_7J8eVI9o4", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1687321477, "isDeepV": 1, "flag": 0, "newRatingLevel": 1, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300062265", "format": "epub", "version": 2070890132, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/76/cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq/s_cpplatform_synpjw5u8himr8slrsxrcq1687246558.jpg", "title": "哲学如何塑造了我", "author": "[英]布莱恩·麦基", "payType": 1048577}, "bookFinderSuccessCount": 0, "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}], "totalCount": 8}}